# Binary assets must never receive end-of-line conversion.
#
# The waiver PDFs are ReportLab output with no NUL bytes in the first 8KB, so
# git's content heuristic classifies them as text. With core.autocrlf=true that
# turns every LF into CRLF on checkout and the file no longer opens.
*.pdf binary

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
